---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 text-gray-600 text-xs mt-16">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-8 mb-8">
      <!-- Col 1: About & Mission -->
      <div class="sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded bg-indigo-600 text-white font-bold text-xs">G</span>
          <span class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-base">Gudmud Colleges</span>
        </div>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-gray-500 mb-3">
          Independent college discovery engine built strictly with official public datasets from JoSAA and NIRF. Zero sponsored rankings, zero paywalls, zero lead-capture spam.
        </p>
        <p class="text-2xs text-gray-400">
          Last verified: 15 November 2026
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 2: Predictors & Cutoff Explorer -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Admissions Tools</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li><a href="/cutoff/" class="hover:text-indigo-600 transition">JoSAA Cutoff Explorer 2024</a></li>
          <li><a href="/jee-main-rank-college-predictor/" class="hover:text-indigo-600 transition">JEE Main College Predictor</a></li>
          <li><a href="/jee-advanced-rank-college-predictor/" class="hover:text-indigo-600 transition">JEE Advanced IIT Predictor</a></li>
          <li><a href="/colleges/" class="hover:text-indigo-600 transition">All 119 Participating Institutes</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 3: Cutoffs by Category & Branch -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Cutoffs by Type</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li><a href="/cutoff/iits/" class="hover:text-indigo-600 transition">IIT Cutoff 2024 (23 IITs)</a></li>
          <li><a href="/cutoff/nits/" class="hover:text-indigo-600 transition">NIT Cutoff 2024 (32 NITs)</a></li>
          <li><a href="/cutoff/iiits/" class="hover:text-indigo-600 transition">IIIT Cutoff 2024 (26 IIITs)</a></li>
          <li><a href="/cutoff/gftis/" class="hover:text-indigo-600 transition">GFTI Cutoff 2024</a></li>
          <li><a href="/cutoff/computer-science/" class="hover:text-indigo-600 transition font-medium text-indigo-700">Computer Science (CSE) Cutoff &rarr;</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 4: NIRF & Educational Guides -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Rankings & Guides</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li><a href="/nirf-ranking/engineering/" class="hover:text-indigo-600 transition">NIRF Engineering Rankings</a></li>
          <li><a href="/nirf-ranking/engineering/2024/" class="hover:text-indigo-600 transition">NIRF Engineering 2024</a></li>
          <li><a href="/nirf-ranking/overall/" class="hover:text-indigo-600 transition">NIRF Overall Rankings</a></li>
          <li><a href="/guides/how-josaa-counselling-works/" class="hover:text-indigo-600 transition">How JoSAA Counselling Works</a></li>
          <li><a href="/guides/josaa-rounds-and-seat-types-explained/" class="hover:text-indigo-600 transition">Seat Types & Freeze/Float</a></li>
          <li><a href="/guides/how-to-read-nirf-rankings/" class="hover:text-indigo-600 transition">How to Read NIRF Rankings</a></li>
          <li><a href="/guides/nirf-vs-naac-vs-nba/" class="hover:text-indigo-600 transition">NIRF vs NAAC vs NBA</a></li>
          <li><a href="/guides/how-to-check-if-university-is-ugc-recognised/" class="hover:text-indigo-600 transition">Check UGC Recognition</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 5: Trust, Portals & Network -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Portals & Trust</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li><a href="/official-links/" class="hover:text-indigo-600 transition font-medium text-indigo-700">Official Portals Directory &rarr;</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://convert.gudmud.site/" class="hover:text-indigo-600 transition">Best Converter (Free Tools)</a></li>
          <li><a href="/privacy/" class="hover:text-indigo-600 transition">Privacy Policy</a></li>
          <li><a href="/terms/" class="hover:text-indigo-600 transition">Terms of Service</a></li>
          <li><a href="/contact/" class="hover:text-indigo-600 transition">Contact & Data Corrections</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Mandatory Legal & Compliance Disclaimer -->
    <div class="border-t border-gray-200 pt-6 mt-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-500">
      <p class="font-bold text-gray-700 mb-1">
        Official Affiliation Disclaimer
      </p>
      <p class="mb-3 text-2xs text-gray-500">
        Gudmud Colleges is an independent student information portal and is NOT affiliated with, authorized by, sponsored by, or in any way connected to the National Testing Agency (NTA), Joint Seat Allocation Authority (JoSAA), Central Seat Allocation Board (CSAB), National Institutional Ranking Framework (NIRF), Ministry of Education (MoE), University Grants Commission (UGC), All India Council for Technical Education (AICTE), or any public or private educational institution. All cutoff ranks, opening/closing ranks, and ranking scores are compiled from publicly accessible government archives. Cutoffs, seat matrices, and eligibility rules change every academic session. Students and parents must always verify all information on official counseling portals (<a href="https://josaa.nic.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="underline text-indigo-600">josaa.nic.in</a>, <a href="https://www.nirfindia.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="underline text-indigo-600">nirfindia.org</a>) before making counseling decisions.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between text-2xs text-gray-400 gap-2 border-t border-gray-100 pt-3">
        <span>&copy; {year} Gudmud Colleges. All rights reserved. Zero cookies, zero personal data collection.</span>
        <span>Independent Educational Research</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
